    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">millēnārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		milleni, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>containing a thousand, millenary</i> (postclass.): 
