				 <i><span class="en">Tert. de Anim. 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dux lanceariorum,</span>”
				<i>commander of a thousand</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Hist. Eccl. 6, 35</span></i>
			.</div>
